WEBVTT

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:07.910
There it is.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.000
This is...

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:28.840
I hoped you wouldn't see this.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.510
Better not. I'm faster.

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:37.540
I know.

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:40.140
You don't really want to do this.

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:43.660
"That's what adults do."
 Ever heard that?

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:50.950
Do it, Rex-FE.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.790
Ouch, I can't breath.

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:54.290
Stop, Daitetsu!

00:00:58.030 --> 00:01:00.040
(October, the 47th of Shinka Era
 Ishikawa)

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:18.330
Concrete Revolutio
 ~Superhuman Phantasmagoria~

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:25.410
I heard it
 A voice cursing fate

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:29.580
I found it
 A way to use my power

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:33.330
What you want are not words,
 are they?

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:36.790
That love inside
 I want to send it on

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.660
Justice is not on my side

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:43.910
The only thing absolute for me
 is myself

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:46.620
Come on Wakers. Ready, go!

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:51.500
Protecting the illusions
 that somebody dreamed of

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:56.040
will liberate the stagnant sky

00:01:56.500 --> 00:02:01.660
We hurl our unanswerable cries
 at each other

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:06.500
And they become the reason we live

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:12.160
What can I do in this
 hopeless world we live in?

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:17.250
Only those that keep searching

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:20.080
can become the future

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:24.080
Start the revolution!

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:33.870
Why are you guys here?

00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:36.540
Stand back. This is our job.

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:39.370
They've illegally occupied the school.

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:42.290
Let us talk to the superhumans
 in there first.

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:44.660
Times have changed, huh?

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:50.080
Back then, students used to riot about
 cracking down on superhumans.

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:51.660
Wow, really?

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:54.370
It was around
 the Daitetsu Incident so...

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:55.750
5 years ago.

00:02:56.290 --> 00:02:58.410
You must have been little.

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:00.870
Oh, I wasn't on Earth then yet...

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:01.950
Ouch!

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:06.200
So, what was that Daitetsu Incident?

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:10.080
Your mother is crying now.

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:13.540
Student ID 1653004.

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:16.710
Economics major. Junior, Masaki Iga.

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:19.790
Aren't they Team BB? I mean...

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:21.200
Not DL...

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:23.450
Boys' Detective Team BL.

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:25.500
The leader is Yumihiko Otonashi.

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:27.580
A superhuman, right?

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:30.500
But he's refused to register
 with the Bureau.

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.830
We have no obligation to protect him.

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:35.160
Well, well.

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:36.950
Where's the police?

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:41.000
We're supposed to pretend
 they don't exist.

00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:43.360
Just like you guys.

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:44.370
But...

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:45.700
Listen well.

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:47.790
You're making your mother cry.

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:50.290
That's him. Rin, Saki.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:53.960
(We don't need EDC)

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:55.950
This is bad. Go, Hideaki.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:57.410
Fine.

00:03:58.290 --> 00:03:59.460
Do something.

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:01.840
They work with the police.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.600
Yumihiko Otonashi, leave this to us.

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:08.620
Oh, the Superhuman Bureau.

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:12.160
We're kids, so we don't
 understand grown-up stuff.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:13.900
Like police and protests.

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:15.700
Gigander!

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:22.320
(Gigander Seven)

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:24.750
Where did that come from?

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:28.200
Strange, isn't it?
 It always appears out of nowhere.

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:36.950
We just got him out because
 his mom requested it.

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:38.210
The rest's up to you.

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:47.830
Yes, we're
 the Boys' Detective Team BL.

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:50.700
We're not interested
 in ordinary cases.

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:54.350
Like missing persons
 and infidelity investigations.

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:57.480
Wouldn't surprise me if
 he was being cheated on.

00:04:57.750 --> 00:05:00.910
You young people might not
 know about this.

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:02.870
But I can't go to the police.

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:06.110
Do you know the Eye of Lucifer?

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:09.620
Eye of Lucifer?

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:13.910
You mean Rainbow Knight's enemy?

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:15.950
You shouldn't have, Chief.

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:18.250
Don't mention Rainbow Knight to Jiro.

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:22.760
How dangerous to be looking up
 to that criminal.

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:25.040
Rainbow Knight is...

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:28.640
What does Eye of Lucifer want?

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:30.640
There was a threat.

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:34.140
There's a collector for everything.

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:38.650
This letter came to a man who collects
 Rainbow Knight items.

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.200
Eye of Lucifer.

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:43.620
The evil superhuman that
 nearly destroyed Japan many times.

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:46.290
Some say it's a former
 German army scientist,

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:48.040
or a Chinese magician.

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:52.580
Hey, where are you going?

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:54.000
He's coming tonight, right?

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:55.790
It's not the Bureau's business.

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:57.870
It's probably just a bad prank.

00:05:58.040 --> 00:05:59.040
But...

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:02.800
He already requested Team BL
 to guard his home.

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:05.330
Found out anything?

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:07.800
It's the same no matter
 how I calculate it.

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:10.660
To move something of that size,

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:13.330
there must be some
 unknown energy or engine.

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:14.930
Or maybe magic?

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:18.410
I made inquiries, but there were
 no witches like that.

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:20.040
Inquiries? Where?

00:06:21.410 --> 00:06:24.570
But Jiro's Equus is
 a robot like that too.

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:28.080
But that's the invention of
 the genius Mr. Jaguar.

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:31.330
Something's fishy about
 Yumihiko Otonashi.

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:34.250
I found nothing about his past.

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:36.700
How passionate.
 Is it because Jiro asked?

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:40.830
But he's already curious
 about something else.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.450
Forgive him.

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:45.040
He's a Rainbow Knight fanatic.

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:49.500
Rainbow Knight is
 a superhuman of the past, right?

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:05.190
I'll check again.

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:10.410
Came to watch?

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:12.700
Still curious about Rainbow Knight?

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:18.790
Why's the police being so sneaky?

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:20.290
I was chased away.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:24.950
That collector believes the Knight's
 government homicide theory.

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:27.080
He doesn't believe the police.

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:28.800
Huh? Government homicide?

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:32.930
What are you doing here?

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:36.120
Because you might act on your own.

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:38.000
I did research,

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:40.870
and Rainbow Knight's
 identity is unknown.

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:43.940
The people loved him and
 he cheered up post-war Japan.

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:46.700
So kids were crazy about him.

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:49.690
But his identity was revealed
 5 years ago and he died.

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:52.080
I remember it well.

00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:55.450
He kidnapped some kids
 and demanded a ransom.

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:57.950
He was just another criminal.

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:03.370
That caused the neglected Secret
 Functional Law to become strict again.

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:06.580
Superhumans disappeared
 from the foreground.

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:08.960
But it was a government conspiracy?

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:11.830
It happened in front of my eyes.

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:13.580
He was a hero.

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:15.470
But he died a criminal.

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:17.410
You told me about it before.

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:20.200
That he once saved you from a beast.

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:23.370
Senpai, do you still...

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:26.560
What are you old guys doing here?

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:28.200
We're not old guys.

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:30.700
They might be with Eye of Lucifer.

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:32.280
This is no time for jokes.

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:38.160
What happened?

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:40.950
The Crescent Gun was stolen.

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:45.500
Eye of Lucifer.

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:46.950
What are you doing?

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:50.000
I just thought Rainbow Knight
 might appear.

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:53.580
So the superhuman detective
 likes him too, huh?

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.300
When I was a kid, okay?

00:08:58.040 --> 00:08:59.500
Don't move.

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:08.520
Eye of Lucifer.

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:11.160
Why come back after 10 years?

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:15.860
Are you another one of those
 Rainbow Knight lovers?

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:17.660
What would you know?

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:21.040
Rainbow Knight was just a criminal.

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:22.620
He's of the past.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:29.450
Let's go home, Miss Kikko.

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:30.880
Cook me ramen.

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:53.370
Please, Miss Emi.

00:09:53.870 --> 00:09:56.280
You can find him with your powers.

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:58.280
The kidnapped boy.

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:01.450
Monsters' powers
 aren't always accurate.

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:04.290
Rainbow Knight
 wouldn't kidnap anybody.

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:07.790
You owe me one.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:15.710
Tell me, everybody.

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:35.750
Jiro!

00:10:37.160 --> 00:10:38.790
Daitetsu has been rescued.

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.080
What's wrong?

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:48.960
She went to get the milk
 and found this.

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:51.960
(Tonight at midnight, I will claim
 Rainbow Knight's mask. Eye of Lucifer)

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:54.000
Father, what does this mean?

00:10:59.410 --> 00:11:01.180
What do you want?

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:04.160
The Bureau is
 a secret organization, right?

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:07.200
Magic?

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:10.060
I want you to tell me something.

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:11.370
What is it?

00:11:11.410 --> 00:11:15.620
About Daitetsu Maki that was
 kidnapped by the Knight 5 years ago.

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:18.080
What for? That came out of nowhere.

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:20.410
Rainbow Knight was surrounded
 by the police,

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:22.910
and he lost control
 and self-destructed.

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:26.120
But no records of Daitetsu
 after his rescue.

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:29.750
The police hid him
 to keep the media away.

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:32.000
They assigned him a new registry.

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:34.080
Is that really real?

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:35.330
What?

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.660
Rumors say that

00:11:37.700 --> 00:11:41.680
Daitetsu-boy didn't exist and the
 Knight was framed for a fake crime.

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:45.410
Why would the police do that?

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:46.620
I don't know.

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:51.270
But if there are people that
 believe the Knight is innocent,

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:54.150
I feel bad.

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:56.500
Him again, huh?

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:58.780
Listen. Daitetsu Maki was...

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:02.570
This is good.

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:03.830
More, please.

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:06.200
Nobody invited you.

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:09.500
You got a notice from
 Eye of Lucifer, right?

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:12.200
We'll guard the Knight's mask for you.

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:15.040
I can guard my own home.
 Get out.

00:12:15.950 --> 00:12:18.450
No can do,
 Mr. Superhuman Bureau.

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:21.670
We're going to catch Eye of Lucifer.

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:24.620
Yumihiko? What are you after?

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:28.750
The Knight's mask is stored securely
 in the basement safe.

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:31.330
Nobody can get a hold of it.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:33.790
You had it the whole time?

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:37.560
Rainbow Knight's powers are
 a part of my research.

00:12:39.160 --> 00:12:41.700
How did Eye of Lucifer
 know it was here?

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:43.540
Even I didn't know.

00:12:43.870 --> 00:12:47.250
It must be in the police records,
 so maybe from there.

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:51.160
Detective Shiba said that?

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:53.790
Yes. Daitetsu really existed.

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:56.120
But I'm confused.

00:12:57.370 --> 00:12:58.450
Um, Senpai?

00:12:58.700 --> 00:13:02.000
Maybe Rainbow Knight really was
 just a kidnapper.

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:03.870
It all makes sense now.

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:05.930
Remember what Detective Shiba said?

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:09.390
I just thought Rainbow Knight
 might appear.

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:12.040
Ghost boy, where's Jiro?

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:14.200
That's...

00:13:14.330 --> 00:13:15.410
Hey, Jiro?

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:21.540
What in the world?

00:13:21.790 --> 00:13:25.740
It's Eye of Lucifer.
 He's taken Equus to break the safe.

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:29.370
Impossible.
 Only Jiro can operate Equus.

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:31.950
Anyway, put him back Jiro.

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:33.000
Yes.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:36.200
Good thing it was before
 the announced time.

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.370
Eye of Lucifer!

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:40.630
Not being on time works too.

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:42.370
That mask is a fake one.

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:46.880
He's going to steal the real one
 when we open the safe to check.

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:48.370
It's an old trick.

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:53.950
No sign of forced entry.

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:55.290
The combination?

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:57.330
Just in Emi's and my head.

00:13:57.370 --> 00:13:59.790
Then one of you is the culprit.

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:02.330
It was replaced by a balloon again.

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:04.450
- Darn!
 - It's not our miss.

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:06.410
This could be a problem.

00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:08.530
It wasn't a fake one?

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:14.250
Good thing we didn't register
 at that stupid Bureau.

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:16.790
I wouldn't want to live in secrecy.

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:18.540
Good work.

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:24.550
- Is it...?
 - No way.

00:14:25.870 --> 00:14:27.300
Rainbow Knight.

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:30.550
Is my spare mask in that jacket?

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:34.120
What are you talking about?
 Eye of Lucifer took it.

00:14:34.250 --> 00:14:36.390
- Chase him, not us.
 - Is he real?

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:38.640
He actually showed up.

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:40.370
Let's see if he's real.

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:48.750
Guys!

00:14:48.790 --> 00:14:50.750
Yumihiko, use Gigander.

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:51.780
But.

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:54.000
It's him. The one who...

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:59.120
Gigander!

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:00.290
Seven!

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:21.230
(Gigander Seven)

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:27.330
You work on metal
 to make it move like amoebas.

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:30.950
That's your superhuman power.
 Yumihiko Otonashi.

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:35.450
That's also proof that
 you disguised as Eye of Lucifer.

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:36.700
What?

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:41.500
Why didn't you use Gigander
 when Eye of Lucifer appeared?

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:47.290
You couldn't because
 you were disguised as Eye of Lucifer.

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:49.760
And with your powers,

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:54.040
you could open the safe
 and make it like Equus turned on.

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:58.080
Rainbow Knight knows all.

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:01.500
This is the real thing.

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:03.120
So's this.

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:08.080
In the past,
 I used to be Eye of Lucifer.

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:10.370
I already retired,

00:16:10.410 --> 00:16:13.820
but recently, my family
 has gotten suspicious.

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:16.000
How about this?

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:19.120
Eye of Lucifer returns
 and commits a crime.

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:24.040
You'll be at an amusement park
 with your family and have an alibi.

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:27.250
Nobody will suspect you anymore.

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:30.660
But your real goal was different.

00:16:30.870 --> 00:16:32.840
It was to lure me out.

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:34.540
You were alive.

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:37.220
So there's something I must ask.

00:16:48.580 --> 00:16:49.580
Gigander.

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:52.250
- Kikko?
 - No.

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:53.860
This isn't magic.

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:56.490
Looks like it's after us.

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:58.790
Lots of people want to get back at us.

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:00.790
Let go!

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:11.210
I made this mask long ago.

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:13.910
What do you mean? You tricked me.

00:17:14.200 --> 00:17:15.250
That's right.

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:17.090
Rainbow Knight is dead...

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:18.600
Daitetsu Maki.

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:22.040
(March, the 38th of Shinka Era
 Minami-Senju)

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:33.110
Why are you doing this?

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:35.790
I'm sorry.

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:39.160
All you kids have superhuman powers.

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:42.910
You can control metal, right?

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:46.000
You want to be
 a superhuman of justice, right?

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:48.660
That's why I go to the laboratory.

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:51.790
I want to protect you kids.

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:54.040
As a hero.

00:17:57.040 --> 00:17:59.290
In time, I was rescued by the police.

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:04.540
I learned that Rainbow Knight
 demanded a ransom from the police.

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:38.950
Miss Emi!

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:41.080
This can only do this.

00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:42.290
Crescent Gun.

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:45.390
I'll go.

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:46.910
Meteortail!

00:18:50.370 --> 00:18:53.500
The Bureau won't protect us, right?
 Let me down.

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:56.820
If Rainbow Knight was alive,
 were you going to get revenge?

00:18:57.910 --> 00:18:58.870
I don't know.

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:01.320
But I have to know.

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:04.910
For me, someone like a nice man...

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:07.450
That's my image of him.

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:11.580
I need to make it clear.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:13.500
That he was evil.

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:14.830
And I'll defeat him.

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:16.830
I'm not like him.

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:19.220
I won't become like him.

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:22.090
Justice and evil
 are totally different.

00:19:23.750 --> 00:19:25.750
- You're strong.
 - What?

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:29.410
You can clearly decide
 what's good and what's wrong.

00:19:29.950 --> 00:19:32.100
To be honest, I can't.

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:34.080
I...

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:36.950
I hope to at least be a hero.

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:38.450
A hero?

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:41.120
That's too old.
 It's like being apolitical.

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:42.540
Do you know Giganto Gon?

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:49.080
It's a beast that landed in Tokyo
 10 years ago.

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:53.250
It was actually made from cells
 stolen from a secret lab.

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:54.950
It was a man-made beast.

00:19:57.120 --> 00:19:59.170
It was the Knight that fought it.

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:10.560
You're a superhuman of justice.

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:15.310
No. The most I can do is
 be a hero.

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:22.330
Whether he was good or evil...

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:25.000
I don't have the courage to decide.

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:29.160
But not everyone
 can be black or white.

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:33.250
Even if someone is gray,
 if he believes in justice,

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:35.790
I want to be a hero.

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:38.200
Meteortail!

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:42.830
Senpai!

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:46.620
Gigander!

00:20:58.870 --> 00:21:00.370
Do it, Superhuman Bureau.

00:21:00.410 --> 00:21:02.160
- Kikko!
 - Got it.

00:21:02.450 --> 00:21:03.570
Mr. Jaguar?

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:04.820
Here it goes.

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:31.830
What was that thing?

00:21:31.870 --> 00:21:34.060
A ghost of Rainbow Knight?

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:40.450
You don't have to be black or white.

00:21:40.790 --> 00:21:42.660
You can be gray, huh.

00:21:43.750 --> 00:21:46.080
Here, I'll keep it a secret.

00:21:46.120 --> 00:21:47.080
Give back what you took.

00:21:48.750 --> 00:21:49.950
Huh? Where is it?

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:53.330
Sorry for the trouble.

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:54.660
You owe me one.

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:58.540
Don't oppose the Earth Defense Corps
 anymore.

00:22:01.120 --> 00:22:02.960
I guess it can't be helped.

00:23:33.950 --> 00:23:35.470
(October, the 47th of Shinka Era
 Ishikawa)

00:23:38.950 --> 00:23:41.100
You've grown, Daitetsu.

00:23:41.540 --> 00:23:43.250
And you've become garbage.

00:23:44.540 --> 00:23:47.790
If you're a hero, that makes me evil.

00:23:48.250 --> 00:23:52.700
No. Good and bad can't be
 so easily interchangeable.

00:23:54.200 --> 00:23:55.330
Get ready!

00:23:56.620 --> 00:23:58.450
I'm Sanae Hatakeyama.

00:23:58.500 --> 00:24:01.790
We're your average Japanese family.

00:24:01.790 --> 00:24:04.330
But we've lived just a bit longer.

00:24:04.330 --> 00:24:08.790
And the great Masaki Tsuji
 has made us into a story.

00:24:08.830 --> 00:24:10.790
Please watch next week.
